### Soyuz UI strings (en-US source): tui-requests
### The terminal UI: dialogs the core requests (Phase T3: confirm, select by pattern, columns, open with, recovery, crash reports).
### Keys: <area>-<thing>, kebab-case. Keep keys identical in tr-TR/tui-requests.ftl.


## Confirm
tui-requests-confirm-hints = Enter confirm · Tab next · Esc cancel

## Select by pattern
tui-requests-pattern-field = Pattern
tui-requests-pattern-hints = Enter select · Tab next · Space tick · Esc cancel

## Columns
tui-requests-columns-hints = Up/Down choose · Space show or hide · Enter done · Esc close

## Open with
tui-requests-openwith-hints = Up/Down choose · Enter open · Tab next · Esc cancel

## Interrupted operations
tui-requests-recovery-hints = Up/Down operations · R resume · B roll back · D discard · L or Esc decide later

## Crash reports
tui-requests-crash-hints = Up/Down choose · V view · D delete all · O open folder · C close · Esc later
tui-requests-crash-viewing-hints = Up/Down scroll · V or Esc back to the list
